---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.CreateProjectsLocationsOnlineEvaluatorsRequest
---@field config? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1OnlineEvaluatorConfig Required. Configuration for the OnlineEvaluator.
