---@field ttl? string Optional. Input only. The TTL for the sandbox environment. The expiration time is computed: now + TTL.
---@field state? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentStateEnum|string Output only. The runtime state of the SandboxEnvironment.
