---@field name? string Identifier. The name of the SandboxEnvironment.
---@field connectionInfo? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentConnectionInfo Output only. The connection information of the SandboxEnvironment.
