---@field fullExport? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ExportFeatureValuesRequestFullExport Exports all historical values of all entities of the EntityType within a time range
---@field settings? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1DestinationFeatureSettingList Per-Feature export settings.
---@field featureSelector? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1FeatureSelector Required. Selects Features to export values of.
---@field entityType string Required. The resource name of the EntityType from which to export Feature values. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/featurestores/{featurestore}/entityTypes/{entity_type}`

