---Response for InteractionService.CreateInteraction.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1Interaction
---@field usage? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1InteractionUsage Output only. Statistics on the interaction request's token usage.
---@field created? string Required. Output only. The time at which the response was created in ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ssZ).
---@field agentInteraction? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1AgentInteraction Interaction for generating the completion using agents.
---@field status? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1InteractionStatusEnum|string Required. Output only. The status of the interaction.
---@field content? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1Content The content for the interaction.
---@field errors? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1ErrorList Output only. Diagnostic faults / platform errors recorded on the interaction.
---@field stepList? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1StepList Input only. The steps for the interaction.
---@field responseFormatSingleton? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1ResponseFormat
---@field envId? string The environment ID for the interaction. Can be 'remote' for default environment.
---@field serviceTier? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1InteractionServiceTierEnum|string The service tier for the interaction.
---@field labels? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata for the request. Label keys and values can be no longer than 63 characters (Unicode codepoints) and can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores, and dashes. International characters are allowed. Label values are optional. Label keys must start with a letter.
---@field tools? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1ToolList A list of tool declarations the model may call during interaction.
---@field updated? string Required. Output only. The time at which the response was last updated in ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ssZ).
---@field responseFormatList? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1ResponseFormatList
---@field previousInteractionId? string The ID of the previous interaction, if any.
---@field stringContent? string A string input for the interaction, it will be processed as a single text input.
---@field safetySettings? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1SafetySettingList Safety settings for the interaction.
---@field systemInstruction? string System instruction for the interaction.
---@field modelInteraction? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1ModelInteraction Interaction for generating the completion using models.
---@field steps? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GenaiVertexV1StepList_ Required. Output only. The steps that make up the interaction, when included in the response.
---@field id? string Required. Output only. A unique identifier for the interaction completion.
---@field environmentId? string Output only. The environment ID for the interaction. Only populated if environment config is set in the request.

---Signals that the Interaction completed. Sent when the Interaction receives Complete/Cancel or naturally terminates. No more input can be sent to the Interaction after this.
