---Parameters that configure the active learning pipeline. Active learning will label the data incrementally by several iterations. For every iteration, it will select a batch of data based on the sampling strategy.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ActiveLearningConfig
---@field maxDataItemCount? string Max number of human labeled DataItems.
---@field trainingConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrainingConfig CMLE training config. For every active learning labeling iteration, system will train a machine learning model on CMLE. The trained model will be used by data sampling algorithm to select DataItems.
---@field maxDataItemPercentage? number Max percent of total DataItems for human labeling.
---@field sampleConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SampleConfig Active learning data sampling config. For every active learning labeling iteration, it will select a batch of data based on the sampling strategy.

