---@field oauthConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1AuthConfigOauthConfig Config for user oauth.
---@field googleServiceAccountConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1AuthConfigGoogleServiceAccountConfig Config for Google Service Account auth.
