---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1BatchReadFeatureValuesRequestEntityTypeSpecList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1BatchReadFeatureValuesRequestEntityTypeSpec[]

