---The BigQuery location for the output content.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1BigQueryDestination
---@field outputUri? string Required. BigQuery URI to a project or table, up to 2000 characters long. When only the project is specified, the Dataset and Table is created. When the full table reference is specified, the Dataset must exist and table must not exist. Accepted forms: * BigQuery path. For example: `bq://projectId` or `bq://projectId.bqDatasetId` or `bq://projectId.bqDatasetId.bqTableId`.

---The request set for the evaluation run.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1BigQueryRequestSet
---@field uri? string Required. The URI of a BigQuery table. e.g. bq://projectId.bqDatasetId.bqTableId
---@field candidateResponseColumns? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringMap Optional. Map of candidate name to candidate response column name. The column will be in evaluation_item.CandidateResponse format.
---@field rubricsColumn? string Optional. The name of the column that contains the rubrics. This is in evaluation_rubric.RubricGroup format.
---@field promptColumn? string Optional. The name of the column that contains the requests to evaluate. This will be in evaluation_item.EvalPrompt format.
