---Config for blur baseline. When enabled, a linear path from the maximally blurred image to the input image is created. Using a blurred baseline instead of zero (black image) is motivated by the BlurIG approach explained here: https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.03383
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1BlurBaselineConfig
---@field maxBlurSigma? number The standard deviation of the blur kernel for the blurred baseline. The same blurring parameter is used for both the height and the width dimension. If not set, the method defaults to the zero (i.e. black for images) baseline.

---A list of boolean values.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1BoolArray
---@field values? gcp.aiplatform_v1.BooleanList A list of bool values.

---Config of GenAI caching features. This is a singleton resource.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CacheConfig
---@field disableCache? boolean If set to true, disables GenAI caching. Otherwise caching is enabled.
---@field retentionConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CacheConfigRetentionConfig Optional. Project-level retention type for implicit caching. On `GetCacheConfig` this is populated with the retention the project gets: a project that has stated no preference reports `DURABLE`. On `UpdateCacheConfig`, leaving it unset means the project states no preference. Whether that clears an existing preference depends on `update_mask`; see that field.
---@field name? string Identifier. Name of the cache config. Format: - `projects/{project}/cacheConfig`.

---Configures the retention behavior of GenAI implicit (automatic) context caching for this project.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CacheConfigRetentionConfig
---@field retentionType? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CacheConfigRetentionConfigRetentionTypeEnum|string Optional. Retention type applied to implicit cache traffic for this project.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CacheConfigRetentionConfigRetentionTypeEnum "RETENTION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"EPHEMERAL"|"DURABLE"

---A resource used in LLM queries for users to explicitly specify what to cache and how to cache.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CachedContent
---@field systemInstruction? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Content Optional. Input only. Immutable. Developer set system instruction. Currently, text only
---@field model? string Immutable. The name of the `Model` to use for cached content. Currently, only the published Gemini base models are supported, in form of projects/{PROJECT}/locations/{LOCATION}/publishers/google/models/{MODEL}
---@field displayName? string Optional. Immutable. The user-generated meaningful display name of the cached content.
---@field contents? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ContentList Optional. Input only. Immutable. The content to cache
---@field name? string Immutable. Identifier. The server-generated resource name of the cached content Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/cachedContents/{cached_content}
---@field updateTime? string Output only. When the cache entry was last updated in UTC time.
---@field expireTime? string Timestamp of when this resource is considered expired. This is *always* provided on output, regardless of what was sent on input.
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EncryptionSpec Input only. Immutable. Customer-managed encryption key spec for a `CachedContent`. If set, this `CachedContent` and all its sub-resources will be secured by this key.
---@field ttl? string Input only. The TTL for this resource. The expiration time is computed: now + TTL.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Creation time of the cache entry.
---@field usageMetadata? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CachedContentUsageMetadata Output only. Metadata on the usage of the cached content.
---@field tools? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ToolList Optional. Input only. Immutable. A list of `Tools` the model may use to generate the next response
---@field toolConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ToolConfig Optional. Input only. Immutable. Tool config. This config is shared for all tools

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CachedContentList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CachedContent[]

