---A response candidate generated from the model.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Candidate
---@field groundingMetadata? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1GroundingMetadata Output only. Metadata returned when grounding is enabled. It contains the sources used to ground the generated content.
---@field safetyRatings? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SafetyRatingList Output only. A list of ratings for the safety of a response candidate. There is at most one rating per category.
---@field logprobsResult? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1LogprobsResult Output only. The detailed log probability information for the tokens in this candidate. This is useful for debugging, understanding model uncertainty, and identifying potential "hallucinations".
---@field finishMessage? string Output only. Describes the reason the model stopped generating tokens in more detail. This field is returned only when `finish_reason` is set.
---@field urlContextMetadata? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1UrlContextMetadata Output only. Metadata returned when the model uses the `url_context` tool to get information from a user-provided URL.
---@field index? number Output only. The 0-based index of this candidate in the list of generated responses. This is useful for distinguishing between multiple candidates when `candidate_count` > 1.
---@field finishReason? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CandidateFinishReasonEnum Output only. The reason why the model stopped generating tokens. If empty, the model has not stopped generating.
---@field content? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Content Output only. The content of the candidate.
---@field citationMetadata? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CitationMetadata Output only. A collection of citations that apply to the generated content.
---@field avgLogprobs? number Output only. The average log probability of the tokens in this candidate. This is a length-normalized score that can be used to compare the quality of candidates of different lengths. A higher average log probability suggests a more confident and coherent response.
---@field continuationToken? string Output only. An optional opaque continuation token returned when `finish_reason` is `CONTINUATION`. Clients can pass this token in a subsequent `GenerateContentRequest` to continue generation.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CandidateFinishReasonEnum "FINISH_REASON_UNSPECIFIED"|"STOP"|"MAX_TOKENS"|"SAFETY"|"RECITATION"|"OTHER"|"BLOCKLIST"|"PROHIBITED_CONTENT"|"SPII"|"MALFORMED_FUNCTION_CALL"|"MODEL_ARMOR"|"IMAGE_SAFETY"|"IMAGE_PROHIBITED_CONTENT"|"IMAGE_RECITATION"|"IMAGE_OTHER"|"UNEXPECTED_TOOL_CALL"|"NO_IMAGE"|"MALFORMED_RESPONSE"|"CONTINUATION"|"TOO_MANY_TOOL_CALLS"

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CandidateList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Candidate[]

---Responses from model or agent.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CandidateResponse
---@field candidate? string Required. The name of the candidate that produced the response.
---@field text? string Text response.
---@field error? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. Error while scraping model or agent.
---@field agentData? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1AgentData Optional. Represents the complete execution trace of a multi-turn conversation, which can involve single or multiple agents. This field is used to provide the full output of an agent's run, including all turns and events, for direct evaluation.
---@field value? any Fields and values that can be used to populate the response template.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CandidateResponseList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CandidateResponse[]

---Result for a single candidate.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CandidateResult
---@field candidate? string Required. The candidate that is being evaluated. The value is the same as the candidate name in the EvaluationRequest.
---@field explanation? string Optional. The explanation for the metric.
---@field rubricVerdicts? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RubricVerdictList Optional. The rubric verdicts for the metric.
---@field score? number Optional. The score for the metric.
---@field error? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. Error while evaluating the candidate for the metric.
---@field additionalResults? any Optional. Additional results for the metric.
---@field metric? string Required. The metric that was evaluated.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CandidateResultList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CandidateResult[]

