---A file that can be referenced by ID from subsequent Claude model requests. The JSON representation of this message matches the Claude Files API File object field-for-field, so that code written against that API parses these responses unchanged.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ClaudeFile
---@field mime_type? string Output only. The media type of the file, taken from the `Content-Type` header of the file part on upload.
---@field filename? string Output only. The original name of the uploaded file, taken from the `Content-Disposition` header on upload. Between 1 and 255 characters. Control characters and the characters `<>:"|?*\/` are not accepted.
---@field id? string Output only. The server-assigned identifier of the file, for example `file_abc123`. This is the ID to pass in subsequent model requests.
---@field type? string Output only. The object type. Always `file`.
---@field expires_at? string Output only. The time at which the file expires and is deleted, set from the `expires_in_seconds` upload form field. Unset for files that do not expire, which is serialised as `null`.
---@field downloadable? boolean Output only. Whether the contents of this file can be retrieved with `DownloadFile`. False for user-uploaded files, true for tool-generated ones.
---@field created_at? string Output only. The time at which the file was created.
---@field size_bytes? number Output only. The size of the file in bytes.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ClaudeFileList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ClaudeFile[]

