---Specifies configuration for exporting evaluation results to Cloud Logging.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CloudLoggingConfig
---@field resourceType? string Optional. MonitoredResource type. Defaults to "global" if unspecified.
---@field tracingContext? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CloudLoggingConfigTracingContext Optional. Tracing context for the evaluation run.
---@field resourceLabels? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringMap Optional. MonitoredResource labels to associate the log with. The backend will automatically inject project and location.
---@field project? string Optional. Google Cloud project to write logs to. Defaults to the request project.

---Tracing context for Observability correlation.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CloudLoggingConfigTracingContext
---@field spanId? string Optional. ID of the Cloud Trace span associated with the current operation in which the log is being written. e.g., `7a2190356c3fc94b`. If a span is being evaluated, this field should be populated.
---@field traceId? string Optional. Trace ID being written to Cloud Trace in association with this log entry. e.g., `12345`, the numeric ID from the resource name. If a trace or span is being evaluated, this field should be populated.
---@field conversationId? string Optional. Unique identifier for a conversation (session thread), used to store and correlate messages within a conversation. The value corresponds to the `gen_ai.conversation.id` field in the the OpenTelemetry GenAI attributes.

