---Represents the spec of disk options.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1DiskSpec
---@field bootDiskSizeGb? number Size in GB of the boot disk (default is 100GB).
---@field bootDiskType? string Type of the boot disk. For non-A3U machines, the default value is "pd-ssd", for A3U machines, the default value is "hyperdisk-balanced". Valid values: "pd-ssd" (Persistent Disk Solid State Drive), "pd-standard" (Persistent Disk Hard Disk Drive) or "hyperdisk-balanced".

---DNS peering configuration. These configurations are used to create DNS peering zones in the Vertex tenant project VPC, enabling resolution of records within the specified domain hosted in the target network's Cloud DNS.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1DnsPeeringConfig
---@field targetProject? string Required. The project ID hosting the Cloud DNS managed zone that contains the 'domain'. The Vertex AI Service Agent requires the dns.peer role on this project.
---@field domain? string Required. The DNS name suffix of the zone being peered to, e.g., "my-internal-domain.corp.". Must end with a dot.
---@field targetNetwork? string Required. The VPC network name in the target_project where the DNS zone specified by 'domain' is visible.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1DnsPeeringConfigList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1DnsPeeringConfig[]

