---Request message for PredictionService.EmbedContent.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EmbedContentRequest
---@field content? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Content Required. The content to be embedded.
---@field autoTruncate? boolean Optional. Deprecated: Please use EmbedContentConfig.auto_truncate instead. Whether to silently truncate the input content if it's longer than the maximum sequence length.
---@field model? string Required. The name of the publisher model requested to serve the prediction. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/publishers/*/models/*`
---@field outputDimensionality? number Optional. Deprecated: Please use EmbedContentConfig.output_dimensionality instead. Reduced dimension for the output embedding. If set, excessive values in the output embedding are truncated from the end.
---@field taskType? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EmbedContentRequestTaskTypeEnum|string Optional. Deprecated: Please use EmbedContentConfig.task_type instead. The task type of the embedding.
---@field title? string Optional. Deprecated: Please use EmbedContentConfig.title instead. The title for the text.
---@field embedContentConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EmbedContentRequestEmbedContentConfig Optional. Configuration for the EmbedContent request.

---Configurations for the EmbedContent API.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EmbedContentRequestEmbedContentConfig
---@field audioTrackExtraction? boolean Optional. Whether to extract audio from video content.
---@field autoTruncate? boolean Optional. Whether to silently truncate the input content if it's longer than the maximum sequence length. Only applicable to text-only embedding models.
---@field outputDimensionality? number Optional. Reduced dimension for the output embedding. If set, excessive values in the output embedding are truncated from the end.
---@field title? string Optional. The title for the text. Only applicable to text-only embedding models.
---@field taskType? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EmbedContentRequestEmbedContentConfigTaskTypeEnum|string Optional. The task type of the embedding. Only applicable to text-only embedding models.
---@field documentOcr? boolean Optional. Whether to enable OCR for document content.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EmbedContentRequestEmbedContentConfigTaskTypeEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"RETRIEVAL_QUERY"|"RETRIEVAL_DOCUMENT"|"SEMANTIC_SIMILARITY"|"CLASSIFICATION"|"CLUSTERING"|"QUESTION_ANSWERING"|"FACT_VERIFICATION"|"CODE_RETRIEVAL_QUERY"

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EmbedContentRequestList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EmbedContentRequest[]

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EmbedContentRequestTaskTypeEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"RETRIEVAL_QUERY"|"RETRIEVAL_DOCUMENT"|"SEMANTIC_SIMILARITY"|"CLASSIFICATION"|"CLUSTERING"|"QUESTION_ANSWERING"|"FACT_VERIFICATION"|"CODE_RETRIEVAL_QUERY"

