---@field distance? number The distance of this item to the annotation.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ErrorAnalysisAnnotationAttributedItemList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ErrorAnalysisAnnotationAttributedItem[]

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ErrorAnalysisAnnotationList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ErrorAnalysisAnnotation[]

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ErrorAnalysisAnnotationQueryTypeEnum "QUERY_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"ALL_SIMILAR"|"SAME_CLASS_SIMILAR"|"SAME_CLASS_DISSIMILAR"

