---@field developerInstruction? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EvaluationInstanceInstanceData Optional. Contains instructions from the developer for the agent. Can be static or a dynamic prompt template used with the `AgentEvent.state_delta` field.
---@field tools? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EvaluationInstanceDeprecatedAgentConfigTools List of tools.
---@field description? string Optional. A high-level description of the agent's role and responsibilities. Critical for evaluating if the agent is routing tasks correctly.
---@field agentType? string Optional. The type or class of the agent (e.g., "LlmAgent", "RouterAgent", "ToolUseAgent"). Useful for the autorater to understand the expected behavior of the agent.
