---@field agentId? string Optional. Unique identifier of the agent. This ID is used to refer to this agent, e.g., in AgentEvent.author, or in the `sub_agents` field. It must be unique within the `agents` map.
---@field subAgents? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringList Optional. The list of valid agent IDs (names) that this agent can delegate to. This defines the directed edges in the agent system graph topology.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EvaluationInstanceDeprecatedAgentConfigMap { [string]: gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EvaluationInstanceDeprecatedAgentConfig }

