---@field turnId? string Optional. A unique identifier for the turn. Useful for referencing specific turns across systems.
---@field events? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EvaluationInstanceDeprecatedAgentDataAgentEventList Optional. The list of events that occurred during this turn.

