---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this item was last updated.
---@field agentConfigs? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1AgentConfigMap Optional. Static configurations for each agent associated with the items in this set. Key: `agent_id` (matches the `author` field in `events`). Value: The static configuration of the agent.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EvaluationSetList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EvaluationSet[]

---An edge describing the relationship between an Artifact and an Execution in a lineage graph.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Event
---@field artifact? string Required. The relative resource name of the Artifact in the Event.
---@field labels? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata to annotate Events. Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. No more than 64 user labels can be associated with one Event (System labels are excluded). See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information and examples of labels. System reserved label keys are prefixed with "aiplatform.googleapis.com/" and are immutable.
---@field eventTime? string Output only. Time the Event occurred.
---@field type? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EventTypeEnum|string Required. The type of the Event.
---@field execution? string Output only. The relative resource name of the Execution in the Event.

---Actions are parts of events that are executed by the agent.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EventActions
---@field escalate? boolean Optional. The agent is escalating to a higher level agent.
---@field skipSummarization? boolean Optional. If true, it won't call model to summarize function response. Only used for function_response event.
---@field artifactDelta? gcp.aiplatform_v1.IntegerMap Optional. Indicates that the event is updating an artifact. key is the filename, value is the version.
---@field transferAgent? string Optional. If set, the event transfers to the specified agent.
---@field requestedAuthConfigs? gcp.aiplatform_v1.DocumentMap Optional. Will only be set by a tool response indicating tool request euc. Struct key is the function call id since one function call response (from model) could correspond to multiple function calls. Struct value is the required auth config, which can be another struct.
---@field stateDelta? gcp.aiplatform_v1.DocumentMap Optional. Indicates that the event is updating the state with the given delta.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EventList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Event[]

---Metadata relating to a LLM response event.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EventMetadata
---@field longRunningToolIds? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringList Optional. Set of ids of the long running function calls. Agent client will know from this field about which function call is long running. Only valid for function call event.
---@field partial? boolean Optional. Indicates whether the text content is part of a unfinished text stream. Only used for streaming mode and when the content is plain text.
---@field outputTranscription? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Transcription Optional. Audio transcription of model output.
---@field branch? string Optional. The branch of the event. The format is like agent_1.agent_2.agent_3, where agent_1 is the parent of agent_2, and agent_2 is the parent of agent_3. Branch is used when multiple child agents shouldn't see their siblings' conversation history.
---@field inputTranscription? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Transcription Optional. Audio transcription of user input.
---@field turnComplete? boolean Optional. Indicates whether the response from the model is complete. Only used for streaming mode.
---@field groundingMetadata? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1GroundingMetadata Optional. Metadata returned to client when grounding is enabled.
---@field customMetadata? gcp.aiplatform_v1.DocumentMap The custom metadata of the LlmResponse.
---@field interrupted? boolean Optional. Flag indicating that LLM was interrupted when generating the content. Usually it's due to user interruption during a bidi streaming.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EventTypeEnum "TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"INPUT"|"OUTPUT"

