---@field exampleGcsSource? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ExamplesExampleGcsSource The Cloud Storage input instances.

---The Cloud Storage input instances.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ExamplesExampleGcsSource
