---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1GenerateContentResponsePromptFeedbackBlockReasonEnum "BLOCKED_REASON_UNSPECIFIED"|"SAFETY"|"OTHER"|"BLOCKLIST"|"PROHIBITED_CONTENT"|"MODEL_ARMOR"|"IMAGE_SAFETY"|"JAILBREAK"

---Usage metadata about the content generation request and response. This message provides a detailed breakdown of token usage and other relevant metrics.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1GenerateContentResponseUsageMetadata
---@field thoughtsTokenCount? number Output only. The number of tokens that were part of the model's generated "thoughts" output, if applicable.
---@field promptTokensDetails? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ModalityTokenCountList Output only. A detailed breakdown of the token count for each modality in the prompt.
---@field promptTokenCount? number The total number of tokens in the prompt. This includes any text, images, or other media provided in the request. When `cached_content` is set, this also includes the number of tokens in the cached content.
---@field cacheTokensDetails? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ModalityTokenCountList Output only. A detailed breakdown of the token count for each modality in the cached content.
---@field totalTokenCount? number The total number of tokens for the entire request. This is the sum of `prompt_token_count`, `candidates_token_count`, `tool_use_prompt_token_count`, and `thoughts_token_count`.
---@field toolUsePromptTokenCount? number Output only. The number of tokens in the results from tool executions, which are provided back to the model as input, if applicable.
---@field cachedContentTokenCount? number Output only. The number of tokens in the cached content that was used for this request.
---@field candidatesTokenCount? number The total number of tokens in the generated candidates.
---@field trafficType? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1GenerateContentResponseUsageMetadataTrafficTypeEnum Output only. The traffic type for this request.
---@field candidatesTokensDetails? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ModalityTokenCountList Output only. A detailed breakdown of the token count for each modality in the generated candidates.
---@field toolUsePromptTokensDetails? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ModalityTokenCountList Output only. A detailed breakdown by modality of the token counts from the results of tool executions, which are provided back to the model as input.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1GenerateContentResponseUsageMetadataTrafficTypeEnum "TRAFFIC_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"ON_DEMAND"|"ON_DEMAND_PRIORITY"|"ON_DEMAND_FLEX"|"ON_DEMAND_OFFPEAK"|"PROVISIONED_THROUGHPUT"

