---@field placeAnswerSources? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1GroundingChunkMapsPlaceAnswerSources The sources that were used to generate the place answer. This includes review snippets and photos that were used to generate the answer, as well as URIs to flag content.

