---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1MemoryBankCustomizationConfigGenerateMemoriesExampleConversationSourceEventList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1MemoryBankCustomizationConfigGenerateMemoriesExampleConversationSourceEvent[]

---A memory generated by the operation.
