---The alert config for model monitoring.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ModelMonitoringAlertConfig
---@field emailAlertConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ModelMonitoringAlertConfigEmailAlertConfig Email alert config.
---@field enableLogging? boolean Dump the anomalies to Cloud Logging. The anomalies will be put to json payload encoded from proto ModelMonitoringStatsAnomalies. This can be further synced to Pub/Sub or any other services supported by Cloud Logging.
---@field notificationChannels? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringList Resource names of the NotificationChannels to send alert. Must be of the format `projects//notificationChannels/`

