---@field goal? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecMetricSpecGoalEnum|string Required. The optimization goal of the metric.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecMetricSpecGoalEnum "GOAL_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"MAXIMIZE"|"MINIMIZE"

