---@field metricSpec? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PairwiseMetricSpec Required. Spec for pairwise metric.
---@field instance? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PairwiseMetricInstance Required. Pairwise metric instance.

---Pairwise metric instance. Usually one instance corresponds to one row in an evaluation dataset.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PairwiseMetricInstance
---@field jsonInstance? string Instance specified as a json string. String key-value pairs are expected in the json_instance to render PairwiseMetricSpec.instance_prompt_template.
---@field contentMapInstance? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ContentMap Key-value contents for the mutlimodality input, including text, image, video, audio, and pdf, etc. The key is placeholder in metric prompt template, and the value is the multimodal content.

---Spec for pairwise metric result.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PairwiseMetricResult
---@field explanation? string Output only. Explanation for pairwise metric score.
---@field customOutput? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CustomOutput Output only. Spec for custom output.
---@field pairwiseChoice? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PairwiseMetricResultPairwiseChoiceEnum|string Output only. Pairwise metric choice.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PairwiseMetricResultPairwiseChoiceEnum "PAIRWISE_CHOICE_UNSPECIFIED"|"BASELINE"|"CANDIDATE"|"TIE"

---Spec for pairwise metric.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PairwiseMetricSpec
---@field candidateResponseFieldName? string Optional. The field name of the candidate response.
---@field systemInstruction? string Optional. System instructions for pairwise metric.
---@field metricPromptTemplate? string Required. Metric prompt template for pairwise metric.
---@field baselineResponseFieldName? string Optional. The field name of the baseline response.
---@field customOutputFormatConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CustomOutputFormatConfig Optional. CustomOutputFormatConfig allows customization of metric output. When this config is set, the default output is replaced with the raw output string. If a custom format is chosen, the `pairwise_choice` and `explanation` fields in the corresponding metric result will be empty.

