---@field instance? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PairwiseSummarizationQualityInstance Required. Pairwise summarization quality instance.
---@field metricSpec? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PairwiseSummarizationQualitySpec Required. Spec for pairwise summarization quality score metric.

---Spec for pairwise summarization quality instance.
