---A RagChunk includes the content of a chunk of a RagFile, and associated metadata.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagChunk
---@field pageSpan? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagChunkPageSpan If populated, represents where the chunk starts and ends in the document.
---@field chunkId? string The ID of the chunk.
---@field text? string The content of the chunk.
---@field fileId? string The ID of the file that the chunk belongs to.

---Represents where the chunk starts and ends in the document.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagChunkPageSpan
---@field firstPage? number Page where chunk starts in the document. Inclusive. 1-indexed.
---@field lastPage? number Page where chunk ends in the document. Inclusive. 1-indexed.

---Relevant contexts for one query.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagContexts
---@field contexts? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagContextsContextList All its contexts.

---A context of the query.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagContextsContext
---@field chunk? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagChunk Context of the retrieved chunk.
---@field sourceUri? string If the file is imported from Cloud Storage or Google Drive, source_uri will be original file URI in Cloud Storage or Google Drive; if file is uploaded, source_uri will be file display name.
---@field text? string The text chunk.
---@field score? number According to the underlying Vector DB and the selected metric type, the score can be either the distance or the similarity between the query and the context and its range depends on the metric type. For example, if the metric type is COSINE_DISTANCE, it represents the distance between the query and the context. The larger the distance, the less relevant the context is to the query. The range is [0, 2], while 0 means the most relevant and 2 means the least relevant.
---@field sourceDisplayName? string The file display name.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagContextsContextList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagContextsContext[]

---A RagCorpus is a RagFile container and a project can have multiple RagCorpora.
