---@field description? string Optional. The description of the RagCorpus.
---@field corpusStatus? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1CorpusStatus Output only. RagCorpus state.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field vectorDbConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagVectorDbConfig Optional. Immutable. The config for the Vector DBs.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this RagCorpus was last updated.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the RagCorpus. The name can be up to 128 characters long and can consist of any UTF-8 characters.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the RagCorpus.
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EncryptionSpec Optional. Immutable. The CMEK key name used to encrypt at-rest data related to this Corpus. Only applicable to RagManagedDb option for Vector DB. This field can only be set at corpus creation time, and cannot be updated or deleted.
---@field vertexAiSearchConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1VertexAiSearchConfig Optional. Immutable. The config for the Vertex AI Search.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this RagCorpus was created.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagCorpusList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RagCorpus[]

