---@field developerConnectSource? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ReasoningEngineSpecSourceCodeSpecDeveloperConnectSource Source code is in a Git repository managed by Developer Connect.
---@field inlineSource? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ReasoningEngineSpecSourceCodeSpecInlineSource Source code is provided directly in the request.

---Specification for the deploying from agent config.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ReasoningEngineSpecSourceCodeSpecAgentConfigSource
---@field inlineSource? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ReasoningEngineSpecSourceCodeSpecInlineSource Optional. Any additional files needed to interpret the config. If a `requirements.txt` file is present in the `inline_source`, the corresponding packages will be installed. If no `requirements.txt` file is present in `inline_source`, then the latest version of `google-adk` will be installed for interpreting the ADK config.
---@field adkConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ReasoningEngineSpecSourceCodeSpecAgentConfigSourceAdkConfig Required. The ADK configuration.

