---@field jsonConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.DocumentMap Required. The value of the ADK config in JSON format.

---Specifies the configuration for fetching source code from a Git repository that is managed by Developer Connect. This includes the repository, revision, and directory to use.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ReasoningEngineSpecSourceCodeSpecDeveloperConnectConfig
---@field revision? string Required. The revision to fetch from the Git repository such as a branch, a tag, a commit SHA, or any Git ref.
---@field dir? string Required. Directory, relative to the source root, in which to run the build.
---@field gitRepositoryLink? string Required. The Developer Connect Git repository link, formatted as `projects/*/locations/*/connections/*/gitRepositoryLink/*`.

---Specifies source code to be fetched from a Git repository managed through the Developer Connect service.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ReasoningEngineSpecSourceCodeSpecDeveloperConnectSource
---@field config? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ReasoningEngineSpecSourceCodeSpecDeveloperConnectConfig Required. The Developer Connect configuration that defines the specific repository, revision, and directory to use as the source code root.

---Specifies source code to be fetched from a public Git repository.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ReasoningEngineSpecSourceCodeSpecGitSource
---@field revision? string Required. The revision to fetch from the Git repository: a branch, a tag, or a full commit SHA. Abbreviated commit SHAs are not supported.
---@field dir? string Optional. Directory, relative to the source root, in which to run the build.
---@field url? string Required. The HTTPS URL of the public Git repository to clone.

---The image spec for building an image (within a single build step), based on the config file (i.e. Dockerfile) in the source directory.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ReasoningEngineSpecSourceCodeSpecImageSpec
