---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RetrievalConfig
---@field languageCode? string The language code of the user.
---@field latLng? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleTypeLatLng The location of the user.

---Metadata related to the retrieval grounding source. This is part of the `GroundingMetadata` returned when grounding is enabled.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RetrievalMetadata
---@field googleSearchDynamicRetrievalScore? number Optional. A score indicating how likely it is that a Google Search query could help answer the prompt. The score is in the range of `[0, 1]`. A score of 1 means the model is confident that a search will be helpful, and 0 means it is not. This score is populated only when Google Search grounding and dynamic retrieval are enabled. The score is used to determine whether to trigger a search.

---The data source for Vertex RagStore.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RetrieveContextsRequestVertexRagStore
---@field ragResources? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RetrieveContextsRequestVertexRagStoreRagResourceList Optional. The representation of the rag source. It can be used to specify corpus only or ragfiles. Currently only support one corpus or multiple files from one corpus. In the future we may open up multiple corpora support.
---@field vectorDistanceThreshold? number Optional. Only return contexts with vector distance smaller than the threshold.

---The definition of the Rag resource.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RetrieveContextsRequestVertexRagStoreRagResource
---@field ragFileIds? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringList Optional. rag_file_id. The files should be in the same rag_corpus set in rag_corpus field.
---@field ragCorpus? string Optional. RagCorpora resource name. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/ragCorpora/{rag_corpus}`

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RetrieveContextsRequestVertexRagStoreRagResourceList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RetrieveContextsRequestVertexRagStoreRagResource[]

