---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RetrieveMemoriesRequestMemoryTypesItemEnumList (gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RetrieveMemoriesRequestMemoryTypesItemEnum|string)[]

---Parameters for semantic similarity search based retrieval.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RetrieveMemoriesRequestSimilaritySearchParams
---@field topK? number Optional. The maximum number of memories to return. The service may return fewer than this value. If unspecified, at most 3 memories will be returned. The maximum value is 100; values above 100 will be coerced to 100.
---@field searchQuery? string Required. Query to use for similarity search retrieval. If provided, then the parent ReasoningEngine must have ReasoningEngineContextSpec.MemoryBankConfig.SimilaritySearchConfig set.

---Parameters for simple (non-similarity search) retrieval.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1RetrieveMemoriesRequestSimpleRetrievalParams
