---@field pathCount? number Required. The number of feature permutations to consider when approximating the Shapley values. Valid range of its value is [1, 50], inclusively.

---Sampling Strategy for logging, can be for both training and prediction dataset.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SamplingStrategy
---@field randomSampleConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SamplingStrategyRandomSampleConfig Random sample config. Will support more sampling strategies later.

---Requests are randomly selected.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SamplingStrategyRandomSampleConfig
---@field sampleRate? number Sample rate (0, 1]

---SandboxEnvironment is a containerized environment that provides a customizable secure execution runtime for AI agents.
