---@field createTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this SandboxEnvironment was created.
---@field latestSandboxEnvironmentSnapshot? string Output only. The resource name of the latest snapshot taken for this SandboxEnvironment.
---@field expireTime? string Optional. Timestamp in UTC of when this SandboxEnvironment is considered expired. This is *always* provided on output, regardless of what `expiration` was sent on input.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this SandboxEnvironment was most recently updated.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the SandboxEnvironment.

---The connection information of the SandboxEnvironment.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentConnectionInfo
---@field serviceAttachment? string Output only. The name of the PSC-E service attachment created for private ingress to this SandboxEnvironment. Only populated when the template enables private ingress (see SandboxEnvironmentTemplate.ingress_control_config). VPC-SC customers use this to create a PSC endpoint in their VPC.
---@field loadBalancerHostname? string Output only. The hostname of the load balancer.
---@field sandboxInternalIp? string Output only. The internal IP address of the SandboxEnvironment.
---@field loadBalancerIp? string Output only. The IP address of the load balancer.
---@field routingToken? string Output only. The routing token for the SandboxEnvironment.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironment[]

---SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot is a snapshot of the SandboxEnvironment.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot
---@field name? string Identifier. The resource name of the SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/reasoningEngines/{reasoning_engine}/sandboxEnvironmentSnapshots/{sandbox_environment_snapshot}`
---@field postSnapshotAction? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentSnapshotPostSnapshotActionEnum Optional. Input only. Action to take on the source SandboxEnvironment after the snapshot is taken. This field is only used in CreateSandboxEnvironmentSnapshotRequest and it is not stored in the resource.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot was created.
---@field owner? string Optional. Owner information for this sandbox snapshot. Different owners will have isolations on snapshot storage and identity. If not set, snapshot will be created as the default owner.
---@field parentSnapshot? string Output only. The resource name of the parent SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot. Empty if this is a root Snapshot (the first snapshot from a newly created sandbox). Can be used to reconstruct the whole ancestry tree of snapshots.
---@field sizeBytes? string Optional. Output only. Size of the snapshot data in bytes.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this SandboxEnvironment was most recently updated.
