---@field sourceSandboxEnvironment? string Required. The resource name of the source SandboxEnvironment this snapshot was taken from.
---@field ttl? string Optional. Input only. The TTL for the sandbox environment snapshot. The expiration time is computed: now + TTL.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentSnapshotList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot[]

