---The shell environment.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentSpecShellEnvironment

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentStateEnum "STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"STATE_PROVISIONING"|"STATE_RUNNING"|"STATE_DEPROVISIONING"|"STATE_TERMINATED"|"STATE_DELETED"|"STATE_PAUSED"|"STATE_PAUSING"|"STATE_RESUMING"|"STATE_STOPPING"

---The specification of a SandboxEnvironmentTemplate. A SandboxEnvironmentTemplate defines a template for creating SandboxEnvironments.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplate
---@field state? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateStateEnum Output only. The state of the sandbox environment template.
---@field ingressControlConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PrivateServiceConnectConfig Optional. The configuration for private ingress (PSC-E) of this template. When set, the sandbox router is exposed privately via a PSC service attachment so VPC-SC customers can connect from their VPC over a private endpoint instead of the public internet. The resulting service attachment is surfaced on `SandboxEnvironment.connection_info.service_attachment`. Only the PSC-E (service-attachment/ingress) portion of `PrivateServiceConnectConfig` applies here: `enable_private_service_connect` and `project_allowlist` (the consumer projects allowed to connect). The nested `psc_interface_config` (PSC-I / egress) is not used for sandbox ingress; sandbox egress is configured via `egress_control_config` instead.
---@field name? string Identifier. The resource name of the SandboxEnvironmentTemplate. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/reasoningEngines/{reasoning_engine}/sandboxEnvironmentTemplates/{sandbox_environment_template}`
---@field createTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this SandboxEnvironmentTemplate was created.
---@field defaultContainerEnvironment? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateDefaultContainerEnvironment The sandbox environment for default container workloads.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this SandboxEnvironmentTemplate was most recently updated.
---@field egressControlConfig? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateEgressControlConfig Optional. The configuration for egress control of this template.
---@field customContainerEnvironment? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateCustomContainerEnvironment The sandbox environment for custom container workloads.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the SandboxEnvironmentTemplate.

---The customized sandbox runtime environment for BYOC.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateCustomContainerEnvironment
---@field ports? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateNetworkPortList Ports to expose from the container.
---@field resources? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateResourceRequirements Resource requests and limits for the container.
---@field customContainerSpec? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateCustomContainerSpec The specification of the custom container environment.

---Specification for deploying from a custom container image.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateCustomContainerSpec
---@field imageUri? string Required. The Artifact Registry Docker image URI (e.g., us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/my-project/my-repo/my-image:tag) of the container image that is to be run on each worker replica.

---The default sandbox runtime environment for default container workloads.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateDefaultContainerEnvironment
---@field defaultContainerCategory? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateDefaultContainerEnvironmentDefaultContainerCategoryEnum|string Required. The category of the default container image.
---@field resources? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateResourceRequirements Optional. Resource requests and limits for the default container.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateDefaultContainerEnvironmentDefaultContainerCategoryEnum "DEFAULT_CONTAINER_CATEGORY_UNSPECIFIED"|"DEFAULT_CONTAINER_CATEGORY_COMPUTER_USE"|"DEFAULT_CONTAINER_CATEGORY_SHELL_SANDBOX"

---Configuration for egress control of sandbox instances.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateEgressControlConfig
---@field dnsPeeringConfigs? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateEgressControlConfigDnsPeeringConfigList Optional. DNS peering configurations that allow sandbox egress to resolve customer-internal domains via the customer VPC.
---@field networkAttachment? string Optional. The name of the customer VPC `NetworkAttachment` used to draw a PSC interface IP into the customer VPC for sandbox egress.
---@field internetAccess? boolean Optional. Whether to allow internet access.

---Configuration for peering a customer's private DNS zone so that sandbox egress can resolve customer-internal domains via the customer VPC.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateEgressControlConfigDnsPeeringConfig
---@field targetNetwork? string Required. The VPC network name in the target_project where the DNS zone specified by `domain` is visible.
---@field targetProject? string Required. The project ID hosting the Cloud DNS managed zone that contains the `domain`. The Vertex AI Service Agent requires the dns.peer role on this project.
---@field domain? string Required. The DNS name suffix of the zone being peered to, e.g., "my-internal-domain.corp.". Must end with a dot.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateEgressControlConfigDnsPeeringConfigList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateEgressControlConfigDnsPeeringConfig[]

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplate[]

---Represents a network port in a container.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateNetworkPort
---@field protocol? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateNetworkPortProtocolEnum|string Optional. Protocol for port. Defaults to TCP if not specified.
---@field port? number Optional. Port number to expose. This must be a valid port number, between 1 and 65535.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateNetworkPortList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateNetworkPort[]

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SandboxEnvironmentTemplateNetworkPortProtocolEnum "PROTOCOL_UNSPECIFIED"|"TCP"|"UDP"

