---@field categoricalValueSpec? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1StudySpecParameterSpecCategoricalValueSpec The value spec for a 'CATEGORICAL' parameter.
---@field conditionalParameterSpecs? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1StudySpecParameterSpecConditionalParameterSpecList A conditional parameter node is active if the parameter's value matches the conditional node's parent_value_condition. If two items in conditional_parameter_specs have the same name, they must have disjoint parent_value_condition.

