---@field floatVal? gcp.aiplatform_v1.DoubleList FLOAT
---@field stringVal? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringList STRING
---@field intVal? gcp.aiplatform_v1.IntegerList INT_8 INT_16 INT_32
---@field listVal? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorList A list of tensor values.
---@field structVal? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorMap A map of string to tensor.
---@field bytesVal? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringList STRING
---@field tensorVal? string Serialized raw tensor content.
---@field dtype? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorDtypeEnum|string The data type of tensor.
---@field uint64Val? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringList UINT64
---@field uintVal? gcp.aiplatform_v1.IntegerList UINT8 UINT16 UINT32

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorDtypeEnum "DATA_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"BOOL"|"STRING"|"FLOAT"|"DOUBLE"|"INT8"|"INT16"|"INT32"|"INT64"|"UINT8"|"UINT16"|"UINT32"|"UINT64"

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Tensor[]

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorMap { [string]: gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Tensor }

---Tensorboard is a physical database that stores users' training metrics. A default Tensorboard is provided in each region of a Google Cloud project. If needed users can also create extra Tensorboards in their projects.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Tensorboard
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EncryptionSpec Customer-managed encryption key spec for a Tensorboard. If set, this Tensorboard and all sub-resources of this Tensorboard will be secured by this key.
---@field blobStoragePathPrefix? string Output only. Consumer project Cloud Storage path prefix used to store blob data, which can either be a bucket or directory. Does not end with a '/'.
---@field runCount? number Output only. The number of Runs stored in this Tensorboard.
---@field etag? string Used to perform a consistent read-modify-write updates. If not set, a blind "overwrite" update happens.
---@field isDefault? boolean Used to indicate if the TensorBoard instance is the default one. Each project & region can have at most one default TensorBoard instance. Creation of a default TensorBoard instance and updating an existing TensorBoard instance to be default will mark all other TensorBoard instances (if any) as non default.
---@field description? string Description of this Tensorboard.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this Tensorboard was last updated.
---@field labels? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata to organize your Tensorboards. Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. No more than 64 user labels can be associated with one Tensorboard (System labels are excluded). See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information and examples of labels. System reserved label keys are prefixed with "aiplatform.googleapis.com/" and are immutable.
---@field name? string Output only. Name of the Tensorboard. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/tensorboards/{tensorboard}`
---@field displayName? string Required. User provided name of this Tensorboard.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this Tensorboard was created.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.

---One blob (e.g, image, graph) viewable on a blob metric plot.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardBlob
---@field id? string Output only. A URI safe key uniquely identifying a blob. Can be used to locate the blob stored in the Cloud Storage bucket of the consumer project.
---@field data? string Optional. The bytes of the blob is not present unless it's returned by the ReadTensorboardBlobData endpoint.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardBlobList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardBlob[]

---One point viewable on a blob metric plot, but mostly just a wrapper message to work around repeated fields can't be used directly within `oneof` fields.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardBlobSequence
---@field values? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardBlobList List of blobs contained within the sequence.

---A TensorboardExperiment is a group of TensorboardRuns, that are typically the results of a training job run, in a Tensorboard.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardExperiment
---@field displayName? string User provided name of this TensorboardExperiment.
---@field description? string Description of this TensorboardExperiment.
---@field labels? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata to organize your TensorboardExperiment. Label keys and values cannot be longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. No more than 64 user labels can be associated with one Dataset (System labels are excluded). See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information and examples of labels. System reserved label keys are prefixed with `aiplatform.googleapis.com/` and are immutable. The following system labels exist for each Dataset: * `aiplatform.googleapis.com/dataset_metadata_schema`: output only. Its value is the metadata_schema's title.
---@field source? string Immutable. Source of the TensorboardExperiment. Example: a custom training job.
---@field name? string Output only. Name of the TensorboardExperiment. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/tensorboards/{tensorboard}/experiments/{experiment}`
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this TensorboardExperiment was last updated.
---@field etag? string Used to perform consistent read-modify-write updates. If not set, a blind "overwrite" update happens.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this TensorboardExperiment was created.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardExperimentList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardExperiment[]

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Tensorboard[]

---TensorboardRun maps to a specific execution of a training job with a given set of hyperparameter values, model definition, dataset, etc
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardRun
---@field displayName? string Required. User provided name of this TensorboardRun. This value must be unique among all TensorboardRuns belonging to the same parent TensorboardExperiment.
---@field description? string Description of this TensorboardRun.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this TensorboardRun was last updated.
---@field labels? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata to organize your TensorboardRuns. This field will be used to filter and visualize Runs in the Tensorboard UI. For example, a Vertex AI training job can set a label aiplatform.googleapis.com/training_job_id=xxxxx to all the runs created within that job. An end user can set a label experiment_id=xxxxx for all the runs produced in a Jupyter notebook. These runs can be grouped by a label value and visualized together in the Tensorboard UI. Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. No more than 64 user labels can be associated with one TensorboardRun (System labels are excluded). See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information and examples of labels. System reserved label keys are prefixed with "aiplatform.googleapis.com/" and are immutable.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this TensorboardRun was created.
---@field name? string Output only. Name of the TensorboardRun. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/tensorboards/{tensorboard}/experiments/{experiment}/runs/{run}`
---@field etag? string Used to perform a consistent read-modify-write updates. If not set, a blind "overwrite" update happens.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardRunList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardRun[]

---One point viewable on a tensor metric plot.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardTensor
---@field versionNumber? number Optional. Version number of TensorProto used to serialize value.
---@field value? string Required. Serialized form of https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/blob/master/tensorflow/core/framework/tensor.proto

---TensorboardTimeSeries maps to times series produced in training runs
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardTimeSeries
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this TensorboardTimeSeries was last updated.
---@field etag? string Used to perform a consistent read-modify-write updates. If not set, a blind "overwrite" update happens.
---@field description? string Description of this TensorboardTimeSeries.
---@field valueType? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardTimeSeriesValueTypeEnum|string Required. Immutable. Type of TensorboardTimeSeries value.
---@field pluginName? string Immutable. Name of the plugin this time series pertain to. Such as Scalar, Tensor, Blob
---@field pluginData? string Data of the current plugin, with the size limited to 65KB.
---@field name? string Output only. Name of the TensorboardTimeSeries.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this TensorboardTimeSeries was created.
---@field displayName? string Required. User provided name of this TensorboardTimeSeries. This value should be unique among all TensorboardTimeSeries resources belonging to the same TensorboardRun resource (parent resource).
---@field metadata? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardTimeSeriesMetadata Output only. Scalar, Tensor, or Blob metadata for this TensorboardTimeSeries.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardTimeSeriesList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardTimeSeries[]

---Describes metadata for a TensorboardTimeSeries.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardTimeSeriesMetadata
---@field maxBlobSequenceLength? string Output only. The largest blob sequence length (number of blobs) of all data points in this time series, if its ValueType is BLOB_SEQUENCE.
---@field maxStep? string Output only. Max step index of all data points within a TensorboardTimeSeries.
---@field maxWallTime? string Output only. Max wall clock timestamp of all data points within a TensorboardTimeSeries.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TensorboardTimeSeriesValueTypeEnum "VALUE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"SCALAR"|"TENSOR"|"BLOB_SEQUENCE"

---Configuration for text-specific output formatting.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TextResponseFormat
---@field schema? any Optional. The JSON schema that the output should conform to. Only applicable when mime_type is APPLICATION_JSON.
---@field mimeType? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TextResponseFormatMimeTypeEnum|string Optional. The IANA standard MIME type of the response.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TextResponseFormatMimeTypeEnum "MIME_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"APPLICATION_JSON"|"TEXT_PLAIN"

---The config for feature monitoring threshold.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ThresholdConfig
---@field value? number Specify a threshold value that can trigger the alert. If this threshold config is for feature distribution distance: 1. For categorical feature, the distribution distance is calculated by L-inifinity norm. 2. For numerical feature, the distribution distance is calculated by Jensen–Shannon divergence. Each feature must have a non-zero threshold if they need to be monitored. Otherwise no alert will be triggered for that feature.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ThresholdConfigMap { [string]: gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1ThresholdConfig }

---All the data stored in a TensorboardTimeSeries.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TimeSeriesData
---@field valueType? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TimeSeriesDataValueTypeEnum|string Required. Immutable. The value type of this time series. All the values in this time series data must match this value type.
---@field tensorboardTimeSeriesId? string Required. The ID of the TensorboardTimeSeries, which will become the final component of the TensorboardTimeSeries' resource name
---@field values? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TimeSeriesDataPointList Required. Data points in this time series.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TimeSeriesDataList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TimeSeriesData[]

