---Config for translation features.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TranslationConfig
---@field echoTargetLanguage? boolean Optional. If `true`, the model will generate audio when the target language is spoken, essentially it will parrot the input. If `false`, we will not produce audio for the target language.
---@field targetLanguageCode? string Required. The target language for translation. Supported values are BCP-47 language codes (e.g. "en", "es", "fr").

---A message representing a Trial. A Trial contains a unique set of Parameters that has been or will be evaluated, along with the objective metrics got by running the Trial.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Trial
---@field webAccessUris? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringMap Output only. URIs for accessing [interactive shells](https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/docs/training/monitor-debug-interactive-shell) (one URI for each training node). Only available if this trial is part of a HyperparameterTuningJob and the job's trial_job_spec.enable_web_access field is `true`. The keys are names of each node used for the trial; for example, `workerpool0-0` for the primary node, `workerpool1-0` for the first node in the second worker pool, and `workerpool1-1` for the second node in the second worker pool. The values are the URIs for each node's interactive shell.
---@field state? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrialStateEnum|string Output only. The detailed state of the Trial.
---@field startTime? string Output only. Time when the Trial was started.
---@field customJob? string Output only. The CustomJob name linked to the Trial. It's set for a HyperparameterTuningJob's Trial.
---@field id? string Output only. The identifier of the Trial assigned by the service.
---@field finalMeasurement? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Measurement Output only. The final measurement containing the objective value.
---@field infeasibleReason? string Output only. A human readable string describing why the Trial is infeasible. This is set only if Trial state is `INFEASIBLE`.
---@field parameters? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrialParameterList Output only. The parameters of the Trial.
---@field measurements? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1MeasurementList Output only. A list of measurements that are strictly lexicographically ordered by their induced tuples (steps, elapsed_duration). These are used for early stopping computations.
---@field endTime? string Output only. Time when the Trial's status changed to `SUCCEEDED` or `INFEASIBLE`.
---@field name? string Output only. Resource name of the Trial assigned by the service.
---@field clientId? string Output only. The identifier of the client that originally requested this Trial. Each client is identified by a unique client_id. When a client asks for a suggestion, Vertex AI Vizier will assign it a Trial. The client should evaluate the Trial, complete it, and report back to Vertex AI Vizier. If suggestion is asked again by same client_id before the Trial is completed, the same Trial will be returned. Multiple clients with different client_ids can ask for suggestions simultaneously, each of them will get their own Trial.

---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrialContext
---@field parameters? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrialParameterList If/when a Trial is generated or selected from this Context, its Parameters will match any parameters specified here. (I.e. if this context specifies parameter name:'a' int_value:3, then a resulting Trial will have int_value:3 for its parameter named 'a'.) Note that we first attempt to match existing REQUESTED Trials with contexts, and if there are no matches, we generate suggestions in the subspace defined by the parameters specified here. NOTE: a Context without any Parameters matches the entire feasible search space.
---@field description? string A human-readable field which can store a description of this context. This will become part of the resulting Trial's description field.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrialContextList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrialContext[]

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrialList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1Trial[]

---A message representing a parameter to be tuned.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrialParameter
---@field parameterId? string Output only. The ID of the parameter. The parameter should be defined in StudySpec's Parameters.
---@field value? any Output only. The value of the parameter. `number_value` will be set if a parameter defined in StudySpec is in type 'INTEGER', 'DOUBLE' or 'DISCRETE'. `string_value` will be set if a parameter defined in StudySpec is in type 'CATEGORICAL'.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrialParameterList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrialParameter[]

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TrialStateEnum "STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"REQUESTED"|"ACTIVE"|"STOPPING"|"SUCCEEDED"|"INFEASIBLE"

---The Model Registry Model and Online Prediction Endpoint associated with this TuningJob.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TunedModel
---@field endpoint? string Output only. A resource name of an Endpoint. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/endpoints/{endpoint}`.
---@field checkpoints? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TunedModelCheckpointList Output only. The checkpoints associated with this TunedModel. This field is only populated for tuning jobs that enable intermediate checkpoints.
---@field model? string Output only. The resource name of the TunedModel. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/models/{model}@{version_id}` When tuning from a base model, the version ID will be 1. For continuous tuning, if the provided tuned_model_display_name is set and different from parent model's display name, the tuned model will have a new parent model with version 1. Otherwise the version id will be incremented by 1 from the last version ID in the parent model. E.g., `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/models/{model}@{last_version_id + 1}`

---TunedModelCheckpoint for the Tuned Model of a Tuning Job.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TunedModelCheckpoint
---@field checkpointId? string The ID of the checkpoint.
---@field epoch? string The epoch of the checkpoint.
---@field endpoint? string The Endpoint resource name that the checkpoint is deployed to. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/endpoints/{endpoint}`.
---@field step? string The step of the checkpoint.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TunedModelCheckpointList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TunedModelCheckpoint[]

---TunedModel Reference for legacy model migration.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TunedModelRef
---@field tuningJob? string Support migration from tuning job list page, from gemini-1.0-pro-002 to 1.5 and above.
---@field pipelineJob? string Support migration from tuning job list page, from bison model to gemini model.
---@field tunedModel? string Support migration from model registry.

---The tuning data statistic values for TuningJob.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TuningDataStats
---@field supervisedTuningDataStats? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SupervisedTuningDataStats The SFT Tuning data stats.
---@field preferenceOptimizationDataStats? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PreferenceOptimizationDataStats Output only. Statistics for preference optimization.

---Represents a TuningJob that runs with Google owned models.
---@class gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TuningJob
---@field baseModel? string The base model that is being tuned. See [Supported models](https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/model-reference/tuning#supported_models).
---@field description? string Optional. The description of the TuningJob.
---@field experiment? string Output only. The Experiment associated with this TuningJob.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Time when the TuningJob was most recently updated.
---@field preTunedModel? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PreTunedModel The pre-tuned model for continuous tuning.
---@field serviceAccount? string The service account that the tuningJob workload runs as. If not specified, the Vertex AI Secure Fine-Tuned Service Agent in the project will be used. See https://cloud.google.com/iam/docs/service-agents#vertex-ai-secure-fine-tuning-service-agent Users starting the pipeline must have the `iam.serviceAccounts.actAs` permission on this service account.
---@field tunedModelDisplayName? string Optional. The display name of the TunedModel. The name can be up to 128 characters long and can consist of any UTF-8 characters. For continuous tuning, tuned_model_display_name will by default use the same display name as the pre-tuned model. If a new display name is provided, the tuning job will create a new model instead of a new version.
---@field labels? gcp.aiplatform_v1.StringMap Optional. The labels with user-defined metadata to organize TuningJob and generated resources such as Model and Endpoint. Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information and examples of labels.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Time when the TuningJob was created.
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EncryptionSpec Customer-managed encryption key options for a TuningJob. If this is set, then all resources created by the TuningJob will be encrypted with the provided encryption key.
---@field gcsMetricsUri? string Output only. The Cloud Storage metrics URI associated with this TuningJob.
---@field error? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. Only populated when job's state is `JOB_STATE_FAILED` or `JOB_STATE_CANCELLED`.
---@field tuningDataStats? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TuningDataStats Output only. The tuning data statistics associated with this TuningJob.
---@field tunedModel? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TunedModel Output only. The tuned model resources associated with this TuningJob.
---@field preferenceOptimizationSpec? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1PreferenceOptimizationSpec Tuning Spec for Preference Optimization.
---@field state? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TuningJobStateEnum|string Output only. The detailed state of the job.
---@field endTime? string Output only. Time when the TuningJob entered any of the following JobStates: `JOB_STATE_SUCCEEDED`, `JOB_STATE_FAILED`, `JOB_STATE_CANCELLED`, `JOB_STATE_EXPIRED`.
---@field startTime? string Output only. Time when the TuningJob for the first time entered the `JOB_STATE_RUNNING` state.
---@field name? string Output only. Identifier. Resource name of a TuningJob. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/tuningJobs/{tuning_job}`
---@field evaluateDatasetRuns? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1EvaluateDatasetRunList Output only. Evaluation runs for the Tuning Job.
---@field supervisedTuningSpec? gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1SupervisedTuningSpec Tuning Spec for Supervised Fine Tuning.

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TuningJobList gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TuningJob[]

---@alias gcp.aiplatform_v1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1TuningJobStateEnum "JOB_STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"JOB_STATE_QUEUED"|"JOB_STATE_PENDING"|"JOB_STATE_RUNNING"|"JOB_STATE_SUCCEEDED"|"JOB_STATE_FAILED"|"JOB_STATE_CANCELLING"|"JOB_STATE_CANCELLED"|"JOB_STATE_PAUSED"|"JOB_STATE_EXPIRED"|"JOB_STATE_UPDATING"|"JOB_STATE_PARTIALLY_SUCCEEDED"

