---@field force? boolean Optional. Flag to indicate to actually perform the purge. If `force` is set to false, the method will return a sample of Artifact names that would be deleted.
---@field parent string Required. The metadata store to purge Artifacts from. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/metadataStores/{metadatastore}`

